54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->At Evri, we provide a cheap and convenient parcel delivery service. As the UK&#39;s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, we deliver over 800 million packages a year to 200+ countries and territories<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div></section><section id="why-choose-evri?" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--neutral" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container--image-right landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thBpbqstJ9-e9Y_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6183a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thBpbqstJ9-e9Y_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6183.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thBpbqstJ9-e9Y_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6183.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thBpbqstJ9-e9Y_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6183.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri courier smiling and posing for the camera in a residential area holding a parcel." width="8192" height="5464" class="landing-feature-banner__image landing-feature-banner__image--image-right" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--image-right landing-feature-banner__content--neutral landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Why choose Evri?</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--neutral" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Enjoy all these great benefits with each parcel you send with us:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Regular tracking updates<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - Keep updated on your parcel&#39;s progress with end-to-end tracking and email notifications for your recipient at no extra cost<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Parcel cover<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover, and you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Customs made easier<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we&#39;ll do the rest<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Flexible printing options<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Bulk Send<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - Book multiple parcels online all at once using our Bulk Send tool<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShop Priority<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - Get your parcel delivered to selected destinations even faster, including the USA, France and Ireland<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div></section><section id="international-parcel-delivery-is-cheaper-than-you-think" class="pricing-table" index="4" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="pricing-table__container" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="pricing-table__content" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="reusable-table__wrapper" data-v-ae5ccddd data-v-0e99fcf9><table class="reusable-table__table reusable-table__table--header-row-blue" data-v-0e99fcf9><thead class="reusable-table__titles" data-v-0e99fcf9><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><th data-v-0e99fcf9>International destination</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Standard ParcelShop</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Standard collection</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>ParcelShop Priority</th><!--]--></tr></thead><tbody class="reusable-table__data" data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>USA</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£10.89</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£11.39</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£11.59</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Australia</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£10.59</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£11.09</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£11.69</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>France</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£8.79</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£9.29</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£9.29</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Germany</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£7.29</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£7.79</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£7.69</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Ireland</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£7.89</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£8.39</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£8.39</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Spain</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£8.59</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£9.09</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£9.09</td><!--]--></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><p class="pricing-table__description" data-v-ae5ccddd>Prices quoted are for a 250g tracked parcel delivery and may change outside the EU based on the volumetric weight of parcels.</p></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section" data-v-ae5ccddd><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/95a31432-bf10-413e-aa05-3a70ce8db491_cheaper.svg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max" srcset="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/95a31432-bf10-413e-aa05-3a70ce8db491_cheaper.svg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/95a31432-bf10-413e-aa05-3a70ce8db491_cheaper.svg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/95a31432-bf10-413e-aa05-3a70ce8db491_cheaper.svg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Cheaper" width="510" height="76" class="pricing-table__save-section-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-ae5ccddd><h2 class="pricing-table__save-section-title" data-v-ae5ccddd>International parcel delivery is cheaper than you think</h2><div class="pricing-table__save-section-subheader" data-v-ae5ccddd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->See our international pricing<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section-buttons-container" data-v-ae5ccddd><!----><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link pricing-table__save-section-button" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/international-prices" data-v-ae5ccddd style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->See more prices<!--]--></span></a></div></div></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="5" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="how-to-send-your-parcel-internationally" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-5d43a0fc>How to send your parcel internationally</h2><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-5d43a0fc>Ready to begin international shipping from the UK? Here are the five steps you’ll need to follow when booking your parcel:</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>1</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Fill in the important information</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->In order for us to deliver your parcel, we need to know where it is going, where to pick it up, how big it is, and how much it weighs, so be sure to fill in all these details correctly.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>2</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Choose your delivery type</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Whether that’s via ParcelShop, Locker, or Courier Collection, we’ll need to know how you’ll be sending your parcel to get the right price.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>3</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Fill in your parcel’s details</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Let us know what’s in your parcel and its value, as well as whether you want to add additional cover.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>4</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Add in additional details</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Tell us the specific address of your parcel, as well as whether you want to provide your recipient with tracking updates. We’ll also need you to provide your return address, email, and phone number in case we’re unable to deliver your package.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>5</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>The finishing touches</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With all the necessary details written down, you can pay for your parcel and print off its delivery label.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="3-easy-ways-to-send-with-evri" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->3 EASY ways to send with Evri<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We’ve made sending your international parcels quick and convenient thanks to our three easy options for you to choose from:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7b6kZ7c43Q3f_73_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847-1-d658.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7b6kZ7c43Q3f_73_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=4%2C0%2C991%2C666&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7b6kZ7c43Q3f_73_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=4%2C0%2C991%2C666&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7b6kZ7c43Q3f_73_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=4%2C0%2C991%2C666&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer stood outside of a ParcelShop store smiling and holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront." width="1000" height="672" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShop parcel drop off<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Simply drop off your parcel at one of 9,000+ ParcelShops across the UK and we&#39;ll do the rest. A ParcelShop is just the name for our handy parcel services at certain stores, such as corner shops, newsagents or supermarkets.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="a-Parcelshop more information" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->ParcelShops<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/29b7db01-898f-4593-93e3-93d72ee215b0_lockerimage23146.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/29b7db01-898f-4593-93e3-93d72ee215b0_lockerimage2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=20%2C0%2C4960%2C3333&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/29b7db01-898f-4593-93e3-93d72ee215b0_lockerimage2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=20%2C0%2C4960%2C3333&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/29b7db01-898f-4593-93e3-93d72ee215b0_lockerimage2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=20%2C0%2C4960%2C3333&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Woman opening blue locker to place cardboard box inside" width="1000" height="672" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Locker parcel drop off<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Lockers are a quick and easy way to drop off your parcel. We have Lockers handily located across the UK, open 24/7. Each Locker is a self-service parcel drop off, located at places like retailers, petrol stations and supermarkets.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="a-Locker more information" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops/lockers" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Lockers<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDoZbqstJ9-cff_EVRI_LOCATION_04_428756f0.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDoZbqstJ9-cff_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4287.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=31%2C0%2C8131%2C5464&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDoZbqstJ9-cff_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4287.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=31%2C0%2C8131%2C5464&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDoZbqstJ9-cff_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4287.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=31%2C0%2C8131%2C5464&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier smiling towards a customer after having completed a doorstep collection. The courier is holding multiple parcels, whilst the customer is holding a blue slip containing the details of the delivery." width="1000" height="672" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Courier parcel collection<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Book a parcel collection from home or work and your local Evri courier will pick it up whenever works for you, with a 1-hour collection window.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="a-Courier more information" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/our-services/courier-service" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Courier collection<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="bulk-sending-parcels" class="section-wrapper integrations-block integrations-block--pb-0" index="7" data-v-7faeaee1 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper integrations-block__card" data-v-7faeaee1 data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="integrations-block__text-wrapper" data-v-7faeaee1><h2 class="u-font-style-h3 integrations-block__title" data-v-7faeaee1>Bulk sending parcels</h2><p class="integrations-block__desc" data-v-7faeaee1>If you send lots of parcels, you can sort them in seconds by connecting your Evri account with eBay, Amazon and Shopify. You can also upload a CSV file - whatever&#39;s easiest!</p></div><!--[--><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link integrations-block__button" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/customer/bulk-upload" data-v-7faeaee1 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->View integrations<!--]--></span></a><!--]--><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><div class="integrations-block__svg-wrapper" data-v-7faeaee1><svg viewBox="0 0 114 45" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" title="ebay logo" data-v-7faeaee1><path d="M15.027 9.81C7.057 9.81.425 13.177.425 23.313c0 8.035 4.46 13.087 14.81 13.087 12.191 0 12.964-7.978 12.964-7.978h-5.924s-1.271 4.285-7.427 4.285c-5.025 0-8.625-3.368-8.625-8.096h22.572v-2.954c.028-4.669-2.945-11.842-13.768-11.842v-.007Zm-.22 3.782c4.758 0 8.028 2.895 8.028 7.268H6.402c0-4.639 4.253-7.268 8.415-7.268h-.01Z" fill="#E53238" data-v-7faeaee1></path><path d="M28.823 0v31.32c0 1.772-.119 4.285-.119 4.285h5.621s.208-1.802.208-3.427c0 0 2.