 area holding a parcel.","international-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6thBpbqstJ9-e9Y_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6183.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z6thBpbqstJ9-e9Y",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},true,{"link_type":120},{"link_type":120},"landing_feature_banner$96fd3c36-d32b-4e3b-9e0f-b44f89420ccd",{"variation":64,"version":17,"items":174,"primary":202,"id":226,"slice_type":227,"slice_label":37},[175,180,185,189,194,198],{"column_1_cell":176,"column_2_cell":177,"column_3_cell":178,"column_4_cell":179},"USA","£10.89","£11.39","£11.59",{"column_1_cell":181,"column_2_cell":182,"column_3_cell":183,"column_4_cell":184},"Australia","£10.59","£11.09","£11.69",{"column_1_cell":186,"column_2_cell":187,"column_3_cell":188,"column_4_cell":188},"France","£8.79","£9.29",{"column_1_cell":190,"column_2_cell":191,"column_3_cell":192,"column_4_cell":193},"Germany","£7.29","£7.79","£7.69",{"column_1_cell":195,"column_2_cell":196,"column_3_cell":197,"column_4_cell":197},"Ireland","£7.89","£8.39",{"column_1_cell":199,"column_2_cell":200,"column_3_cell":201,"column_4_cell":201},"Spain","£8.59","£9.09",{"PricingTableImage":203,"PricingTableHeader":211,"PricingTableText":212,"PricingTableButtonText":216,"PricingTableButtonUrl":217,"scrollDown":69,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonText":37,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonUrl":220,"buttonGtmTrack":37,"PricingTableDescription":221,"table_header_row_blue":169,"table_rightmost_column_blue":69,"column_name_1":222,"column_name_2":223,"column_name_3":224,"column_name_4":225},{"dimensions":204,"alt":207,"copyright":37,"url":208,"id":209,"edit":210},{"width":205,"height":206},510,76,"Cheaper","international-send.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F95a31432-bf10-413e-aa05-3a70ce8db491_cheaper.svg?auto=compress,format","YvNdexIAACAAf1p9",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},"International parcel delivery is cheaper than you think",[213],{"type":107,"text":214,"spans":215,"direction":110},"See our international pricing",[],"See more prices",{"link_type":22,"key":218,"url":219},"769025a6-d615-43f3-af99-cd097de58186","\u002Finternational-prices",{"link_type":120},"Prices quoted are for a 250g tracked parcel delivery and may change outside the EU based on the volumetric weight of parcels.","International destination","Standard ParcelShop","Standard collection","ParcelShop Priority","pricing_table_v2$836e0821-82d5-4e91-a924-ed821daa890c","pricing_table_v2",{"variation":229,"version":17,"items":230,"primary":261,"id":264,"slice_type":265,"slice_label":37},"listNoIcon",[231,237,243,249,255],{"title":232,"content":233,"isNumbered":169},"Fill in the important information",[234],{"type":107,"text":235,"spans":236,"direction":110},"In order for us to deliver your parcel, we need to know where it is going, where to pick it up, how big it is, and how much it weighs, so be sure to fill in all these details correctly.",[],{"title":238,"content":239,"isNumbered":169},"Choose your delivery type",[240],{"type":107,"text":241,"spans":242,"direction":110},"Whether that’s via ParcelShop, Locker, or Courier Collection, we’ll need to know how you’ll be sending your parcel to get the right price.",[],{"title":244,"content":245,"isNumbered":169},"Fill in your parcel’s details",[246],{"type":107,"text":247,"spans":248,"direction":110},"Let us know what’s in your parcel and its value, as well as whether you want to add additional cover.",[],{"title":250,"content":251,"isNumbered":169},"Add in additional details",[252],{"type":107,"text":253,"spans":254,"direction":110},"Tell us the specific address of your parcel, as well as whether you want to provide your recipient with tracking updates. We’ll also need you to provide your return address, email, and phone number in case we’re unable to deliver your package.",[],{"title":256,"content":257,"isNumbered":169},"The finishing touches",[258],{"type":107,"text":259,"spans":260,"direction":110},"With all the necessary details written down, you can pay for your parcel and print off its delivery label.",[],{"theme":102,"title":262,"description":263,"showPaddingTop":169},"How to send your parcel internationally","Ready to begin international shipping from the UK? Here are the five steps you’ll need to follow when booking your parcel:","list_block$25952acd-7b8a-4cdf-bce4-c20f2346b801","list_block",{"variation":267,"version":17,"items":268,"primary":338,"id":348,"slice_type":349,"slice_label":37},"3Column",[269,294,316],{"Title":270,"Description":275,"Image":279,"Label":37,"UrlText":288,"Url":289,"buttonDataGtmTrack":292,"SecondaryButtonText":37,"SecondaryButtonUrl":293,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":37,"ShowAppDownloadCta":69},[271],{"type":272,"text":273,"spans":274,"direction":110},"heading3","ParcelShop parcel drop off",[],[276],{"type":107,"text":277,"spans":278,"direction":110},"Simply drop off your parcel at one of 9,000+ ParcelShops across the UK and we'll do the rest. A ParcelShop is just the name for our handy parcel services at certain stores, such as corner shops, newsagents or supermarkets.",[],{"dimensions":280,"alt":283,"copyright":37,"url":284,"id":285,"edit":286},{"width":281,"height":282},1000,672,"Customer stood outside of a ParcelShop store smiling and holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront.","international-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7b6kZ7c43Q3f_73_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=4%2C0%2C991%2C666&w=1000&h=672","Z7b6kZ7c43Q3f_73",{"x":287,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},4,"ParcelShops",{"link_type":22,"key":290,"url":291},"266f843b-0b4f-478c-9cbc-417c12b4b449","\u002Fparcelshops","a-Parcelshop more information",{"link_type":120},{"Title":295,"Description":299,"Image":303,"Label":37,"UrlText":310,"Url":311,"buttonDataGtmTrack":314,"SecondaryButtonText":37,"SecondaryButtonUrl":315,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":37,"ShowAppDownloadCta":69},[296],{"type":272,"text":297,"spans":298,"direction":110},"Locker parcel drop off",[],[300],{"type":107,"text":301,"spans":302,"direction":110},"Lockers are a quick and easy way to drop off your parcel. We have Lockers handily located across the UK, open 24\u002F7. Each Locker is a self-service parcel drop off, located at places like retailers, petrol stations and supermarkets.",[],{"dimensions":304,"alt":305,"copyright":37,"url":306,"id":307,"edit":308},{"width":281,"height":282},"Woman opening blue locker to place cardboard box inside","international-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F29b7db01-898f-4593-93e3-93d72ee215b0_lockerimage2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=20%2C0%2C4960%2C3333&w=1000&h=672","Yh4ImxIAACgA8w-8",{"x":309,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},20,"Lockers",{"link_type":22,"key":312,"url":313},"e3cd5446-2405-4f7c-b83d-ecdaece67aee","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers","a-Locker more information",{"link_type":120},{"Title":317,"Description":321,"Image":325,"Label":37,"UrlText":332,"Url":333,"buttonDataGtmTrack":336,"SecondaryButtonText":37,"SecondaryButtonUrl":337,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":37,"ShowAppDownloadCta":69},[318],{"type":272,"text":319,"spans":320,"direction":110},"Courier parcel collection",[],[322],{"type":107,"text":323,"spans":324,"direction":110},"Book a parcel collection from home or work and your local Evri courier will pick it up whenever works for you, with a 1-hour collection window.",[],{"dimensions":326,"alt":327,"copyright":37,"url":328,"id":329,"edit":330},{"width":281,"height":282},"An Evri Courier smiling towards a customer after having completed a doorstep collection. The courier is holding multiple parcels, whilst the customer is holding a blue slip containing the details of the delivery.","international-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDoZbqstJ9-cff_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4287.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=31%2C0%2C8131%2C5464&w=1000&h=672","Z6pDoZbqstJ9-cff",{"x":331,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},31,"Courier collection",{"link_type":